Phase 2 — Kotlin for Android Architecture

Estimated duration: about 1 week at roughly 1.5–2 hours/day.

The main topics are:

UI State
UI Events / Actions
Repository pattern
Use Cases
DTO vs Domain models
Mappers
Dependency inversion
Fake repositories for testing
Small architecture exercise combining everything

This phase is intentionally before Coroutines and Flow.
We first build a clean synchronous architecture,
then in Phase 3 we'll make it asynchronous with coroutines,
and in Phase 4 we'll introduce Flow, StateFlow, and SharedFlow.